---
import LandingLayout from '../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<LandingLayout title="About — biblocal">
  <main>
    <section class="hero-mini">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to home</a>
      <h1>Books belong to everyone.<br/>We're just helping them get around.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">A community project to connect readers, one shelf at a time.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="chapter" id="what-we-are">
      <div class="chapter-header">
        <span class="chapter-number">The Short Version</span>
        <h2>What is biblocal?</h2>
        <p class="chapter-intro">A free tool that connects people through their bookshelves. Build your shelf, find neighbors with similar taste, lend and borrow locally. No algorithms pushing bestsellers. No fees. Just readers finding readers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🌱</div>
          <h3>Community-owned</h3>
          <p>No investors. No ads. No data harvesting. Just a thing we built because we wanted it to exist.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🔓</div>
          <h3>Open source</h3>
          <p>The code is on GitHub. Fork it, improve it, run your own. Ideas want to be shared.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🏘️</div>
          <h3>Hyper-local</h3>
          <p>Your matches are in your neighborhood. Walk over. Have coffee. Remember what that's like.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="chapter alt" id="help-us">
      <div class="chapter-header">
        <span class="chapter-number">A Small Request</span>
        <h2>Help us spread the word</h2>
        <p class="chapter-intro">biblocal only works if people use it. We don't have a marketing budget—we have you. If this thing resonates, here's how you can help:</p>
      </div>

      <div class="help-grid">
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-number">1</div>
          <h3>Tell a reader</h3>
          <p>Think of one person who'd love this. Text them. That's it. Personal recommendations beat everything.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-number">2</div>
          <h3>Share it somewhere</h3>
          <p>Post about it. Tweet it. Put it in your book club's group chat. Wherever readers gather.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-number">3</div>
          <h3>Add your bookstore</h3>
          <p>Know an indie bookshop that should be on here? Add it. They'll thank you. We'll thank you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-number">4</div>
          <h3>Build with us</h3>
          <p>Can code? Design? Write? Have opinions about metadata? We're on GitHub. Pull requests welcome.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="share-box">
        <p class="share-prompt">Copy this link and send it to someone who'd get it:</p>
        <div class="share-url">
          <code>biblocal.com</code>
          <button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('https://biblocal.com'); this.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(() => this.textContent='Copy', 2000)">Copy</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="chapter" id="why">
      <div class="chapter-header">
        <span class="chapter-number">The Longer Version</span>
        <h2>Why we built this</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="story-content">
        <p>
          We kept having the same experience: finishing a book, desperate to talk about it, and having no one to talk to. Meanwhile, that same book sat on a shelf, waiting to be lent out.
        </p>
        <p>
          Libraries are wonderful but limited. Bookstores are great but don't connect readers. Social media is... social media. We wanted something simpler: a way to see what the people around us are reading, and maybe borrow that book we've been hunting for.
        </p>
        <p>
          So we built it. No venture capital, no growth hacking, no "disruption." Just a tool for readers, built by readers.
        </p>
        <p>
          It only works if people use it. That's where you come in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="chapter-aside">
        <span class="marginalia">"A room without books is like a body without a soul." — Cicero. A neighborhood without book-sharing is just a collection of strangers.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <h2>Ready to find your people?</h2>
      <p>Build your shelf. See who's nearby. Start lending.</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn-victorian">Get Started</a>
    </section>

    <Footer />
  </main>
</LandingLayout>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .hero-mini {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at 50% 0%,
      rgba(184, 134, 11, 0.08) 0%,
      transparent 60%
    );
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-burgundy);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    transition: color var(--transition-quick);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-burgundy-dark);
  }

  .hero-mini h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .chapter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .chapter.alt {
    background: var(--color-aged-paper);
    max-width: none;
  }

  .chapter.alt > * {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .chapter-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .chapter-number {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-burgundy);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .chapter-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .chapter-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .value-card {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gold-pale);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    transition: all var(--transition-gentle);
  }

  .value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lifted);
  }

  .value-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
  }

  .value-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .help-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .help-card {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gold-pale);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .help-number {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    background: var(--color-burgundy);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .help-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
  }

  .help-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .share-box {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border: 2px dashed var(--color-gold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .share-prompt {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .share-url {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .share-url code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    background: var(--color-parchment);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gold-pale);
  }

  .copy-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    background: var(--color-burgundy);
    border: none;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background var(--transition-quick);
  }

  .copy-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-burgundy-dark);
  }

  .story-content {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);
  }

  .story-content p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  }

  .chapter-aside {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-gold-pale);
  }

  .marginalia {
    font-family: var(--font-handwritten);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--color-parchment),
      var(--color-aged-paper)
    );
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .cta-section p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-faded);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .chapter {
      padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md);
    }

    .values-grid,
    .help-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
